WEBVTT

00:01.790 --> 00:08.420
<b>Ideals versus reality? What, did Alise and Kaguya
try to start another debate or somethin'?</b>

00:08.880 --> 00:13.670
<b>I recommend putting on your best serious face
and nodding along when they do that.</b>

00:13.880 --> 00:17.250
<b>Come on, Lyla. I'm asking a genuine question here.</b>

00:17.710 --> 00:21.210
<b>If I gather a variety of opinions,
I can figure out the right answer-</b>

00:21.210 --> 00:25.830
<b>Ughhh... You Elves can be SO annoying.</b>

00:26.750 --> 00:30.630
<b>"Right" is subjective.
It's different depending on who you ask.</b>

00:32.250 --> 00:36.790
<b>Whether something's "true" or "correct" is
ultimately up to each of us to decide.</b>

00:36.960 --> 00:41.000
<b>So make a truth that's acceptable to you.</b>

00:43.380 --> 00:46.210
<b>I wish you were this thoughtful all the time...</b>

00:46.580 --> 00:50.920
<b>Excuse you, Lion! I am the pinnacle
of kindness and sincerity!</b>

00:51.330 --> 00:55.630
<b>I'd like you to recall a few of
the "skills" you've passed on to me:</b>

00:56.040 --> 00:59.580
<b>The art of negotiation via blackmail;
a plethora of intimidation techniques;</b>

00:59.580 --> 01:03.130
<b>surefire ways to win a bet, plus how to cheat...</b>

01:06.790 --> 01:11.080
<b>Look, if ya wanna take out the trash,
sometimes ya gotta get your hands dirty, y'know?</b>

01:11.540 --> 01:16.670
<b>And while there may be some merit to that, I know more
about these underhanded tactics than I ever wanted to...</b>

01:16.960 --> 01:21.460
<b>You're a young and inexperienced Elf.
I'm just lookin' out for ya.</b>

01:21.630 --> 01:24.170
<b>I won't deny the fact that I'm inexperienced, but...</b>

01:28.540 --> 01:29.750
<b>Listen to me, Lion.</b>

01:29.920 --> 01:32.960
<b>Knowledge is your weapon. Information is your friend.</b>

01:33.290 --> 01:36.170
<b>Everything I've taught you may
very well save your ass someday,</b>

01:36.170 --> 01:40.580
<b>whether it's an unorthodox method of some sort,
or a seemingly random piece of trivia.</b>

01:41.250 --> 01:46.040
<b>It's tough to wrap your head around, I get it.
But it's better than being clueless.</b>

01:46.540 --> 01:50.380
<b>There's no rush, so try and turn
your knowledge into wisdom.</b>

01:51.330 --> 01:53.500
<b>Turn knowledge into wisdom...</b>

01:56.460 --> 02:00.880
<b>If you can do that, then you might
end up saving someone else's ass someday.</b>

02:01.540 --> 02:03.630
<b>And everyone will think you're cool.</b>

02:03.880 --> 02:05.880
<b>You could be the coolest Elf ever!</b>

02:22.670 --> 02:26.630
<b>Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV</b>

03:42.000 --> 03:46.250
<b>Colosseum</b>

03:42.000 --> 03:46.250
<b>Arena</b>

04:14.250 --> 04:15.460
<b>The Colosseum.</b>

04:16.290 --> 04:17.460
<b>The Colosseum...?</b>

04:18.000 --> 04:19.540
<b>It's a fitting name.</b>

04:20.460 --> 04:24.380
<b>The monsters in there spawn infinitely, no matter
how many are defeated. That's its defining feature.</b>

04:24.630 --> 04:25.880
<b>Infinitely?</b>

04:25.880 --> 04:30.920
<b>When one monster disappears,
another one immediately spawns in its place.</b>

04:31.420 --> 04:33.830
<b>In other words, there's a perpetual supply.</b>

04:35.670 --> 04:38.330
<b>A miniature, condensed version of the Dungeon itself.</b>

04:39.170 --> 04:41.460
<b>Not even the Loki Familia goes near it.</b>

04:41.790 --> 04:45.170
<b>It is perhaps the most dangerous area on the 37th Floor.</b>

04:46.210 --> 04:49.420
<b>Miss Ais and the others won't
even set foot in that place...?</b>

04:53.710 --> 04:55.750
<b>We have no choice but to cut across the Colosseum.</b>

04:55.750 --> 04:57.080
<b>Miss Ryu, that's not-</b>

04:57.080 --> 04:59.420
<b>If we reach the other side,
we'll end up at the normal route.</b>

04:59.420 --> 05:03.750
<b>And once we're there, we shouldn't have
much trouble getting to the 36th Floor.</b>

05:03.750 --> 05:04.540
<b>But-</b>

05:04.540 --> 05:08.710
<b>Let me put it this way: If we don't cut across
the Colosseum, we can't get to the normal route.</b>

05:08.710 --> 05:12.710
<b>That's going to make escaping
this Floor extremely difficult.</b>

05:13.710 --> 05:16.330
<b>This is the moment of truth- no...</b>

05:16.580 --> 05:20.080
<b>It's an adventure we can't weasel our way out of.
One we must face.</b>

05:26.170 --> 05:31.040
<b>Now that we've identified the Colosseum,
I've got a better handle on our current location.</b>

05:31.790 --> 05:34.250
<b>There are four different exits in this room.</b>

05:34.750 --> 05:41.460
<b>Of those, the one that leads to the normal route is
positioned directly opposite the passageway we're
standing in.</b>

05:42.080 --> 05:43.920
<b>The side farthest from us...</b>

05:45.040 --> 05:47.170
<b>But how are we supposed to cross the Colosseum?</b>

05:48.080 --> 05:51.380
<b>We won't make any progress against
an endless supply of monsters...</b>

05:51.670 --> 05:54.750
<b>Which is why we want to avoid battling them entirely.</b>

05:55.290 --> 05:58.710
<b>We're going to blend in so that
we don't attract their attention.</b>

06:01.210 --> 06:03.170
<b>A Skull Sheep hide?</b>

06:03.580 --> 06:06.830
<b>That's right. We'll be camouflaged if we wear this.</b>

06:12.040 --> 06:13.500
<b>We'll also disguise our scent.</b>

06:13.500 --> 06:15.540
<b>Was that an item drop...?</b>

06:15.920 --> 06:17.460
<b>A Barbarian Heart.</b>

06:18.290 --> 06:20.500
<b>We'll grind it up and cover ourselves from head to toe.</b>

06:20.960 --> 06:25.920
<b>And so long as we're careful not to make any noise,
we should be able to trick the monsters.</b>

06:27.210 --> 06:30.830
<b>Wow, Miss Ryu... I'd be lost without you.</b>

06:31.460 --> 06:32.420
<b>Mr. Cranel?</b>

06:33.000 --> 06:35.670
<b>You always manage to stay calm,
even in situations like this...</b>

06:36.040 --> 06:37.830
<b>Always making the right choices...</b>

06:38.750 --> 06:40.880
<b>All I'm good for is getting myself into trouble.</b>

06:41.880 --> 06:45.830
<b>I honestly don't think I could escape from
the Deep Floors without your help...</b>

06:49.330 --> 06:52.790
<b>Mr. Cranel, try to turn your knowledge into wisdom.</b>

06:53.500 --> 06:55.170
<b>Turn my knowledge into wisdom?</b>

06:57.130 --> 06:57.830
<b>Yes.</b>

06:59.580 --> 07:01.710
<b>Let knowledge inform your actions.</b>

07:01.710 --> 07:06.830
<b>If you can apply it under the appropriate circumstances,
you'll get better at helping others.</b>

07:07.920 --> 07:10.420
<b>And then you'll be a stronger adventurer.</b>

07:11.210 --> 07:11.920
<b>Got it!</b>

07:15.170 --> 07:20.000
<b>Do you remember the shape of the normal route?
And the mapping technique I showed you?</b>

07:21.170 --> 07:24.210
<b>Yeah. The normal route is a huge corridor.</b>

07:24.750 --> 07:28.580
<b>So long as we don't wander down one of the side paths,
we should reach the adjoining tunnel.</b>

07:29.380 --> 07:32.710
<b>The map is drawn on a scale
where 10 to 20 steps is a unit.</b>

07:33.460 --> 07:34.500
<b>Good work.</b>

07:35.380 --> 07:37.460
<b>We've got three Blazerocks left.</b>

07:38.130 --> 07:39.960
<b>I want you to take one of them with you.</b>

07:40.380 --> 07:41.710
<b>Huh? But...</b>

07:42.500 --> 07:45.290
<b>We have no idea what's going
to happen from here on out.</b>

07:45.960 --> 07:51.040
<b>We ought to divvy up the items so that we can both
defend ourselves, regardless of the situation.</b>

07:52.920 --> 07:53.710
<b>Okay...</b>

07:57.830 --> 07:58.880
<b>Let's move.</b>

08:15.130 --> 08:19.790
<b>If they sense the presence of an intruder,
every single monster will come rushing towards us...</b>

08:21.130 --> 08:23.960
<b>Don't panic. We'll sneak right by without them noticing.</b>

08:59.380 --> 09:00.380
<b>Stay calm...</b>

09:00.670 --> 09:02.790
<b>You're fine, you're fine...</b>

09:32.040 --> 09:33.250
<b>You're fine...</b>

09:34.460 --> 09:35.750
<b>You're doing good.</b>

09:47.630 --> 09:48.670
<b>There it is...</b>

09:49.250 --> 09:50.040
<b>Let's go.</b>

09:50.420 --> 09:51.080
<b>Roger.</b>

10:13.330 --> 10:17.420
<b>I've been told that these monsters remain locked
in a never-ending battle with one another,</b>

10:17.960 --> 10:20.630
<b>except for when an intruder
encroaches upon their territory.</b>

10:37.960 --> 10:39.500
<b>That's the bridge over there.</b>

10:40.380 --> 10:44.710
<b>It's the long way around, but staying on this level is the
safest way to the other side.</b>

10:45.500 --> 10:49.250
<b>Miss Ryu, would that bridge take us to the normal route?</b>

10:49.710 --> 10:51.210
<b>Unfortunately for us, no.</b>

10:52.290 --> 10:54.830
<b>And while the right-hand side is connected to the maze...</b>

10:56.040 --> 11:00.250
<b>...our only viable option is
the bridge directly in front of us.</b>

11:00.670 --> 11:01.460
<b>Got it.</b>

11:12.130 --> 11:14.040
<b>We're walking right above these monsters...</b>

11:15.080 --> 11:18.880
<b>Can we really make it all the way
across without being seen...?</b>

11:30.580 --> 11:33.880
<b>Go away... Go away, go away!</b>

11:43.540 --> 11:44.630
<b>Thank goodness...</b>

11:55.040 --> 11:57.460
<b>Let's move carefully and keep our eyes peeled.</b>

11:57.790 --> 11:58.580
<b>Roger.</b>

12:02.750 --> 12:06.170
<b>Why does a place like this even exist in the Dungeon?</b>

12:07.210 --> 12:10.580
<b>There's a lot we don't know about the Deep Floors.</b>

12:11.500 --> 12:15.880
<b>I've heard stories of an area where
monsters pour endlessly from the walls...</b>

12:16.170 --> 12:18.580
<b>Endlessly? Is that true?</b>

12:19.250 --> 12:24.250
<b>They aren't around anymore, but I'm told that adventurers
from the Zeus and Hera Familias once reported as much.</b>

12:25.460 --> 12:30.040
<b>They said it was almost as though the Dungeon
was testing something down there...</b>

12:30.830 --> 12:31.960
<b>A test...?</b>

12:33.000 --> 12:33.670
<b>Testing what?</b>

12:34.290 --> 12:37.420
<b>Adventurers? Or maybe the monsters...?</b>

13:06.420 --> 13:07.250
<b>RUN!</b>

13:29.420 --> 13:32.000
<b>OUTTA THE WAY!</b>

13:39.580 --> 13:41.210
<b>We mustn't try to face them head-on!</b>

13:41.500 --> 13:43.210
<b>Focus on securing a path forward!</b>

13:48.380 --> 13:49.170
<b>Miss Ryu!</b>

13:55.920 --> 13:59.420
<b>Fire... BOLT!</b>

14:09.790 --> 14:11.330
<b>FIRE BOLT!</b>

14:32.040 --> 14:32.790
<b>It's no use...</b>

14:35.960 --> 14:37.960
<b>No matter how many we kill, they just keep coming!</b>

14:42.290 --> 14:44.710
<b>If we don't do something, they're going to overwhelm us!</b>

14:45.540 --> 14:50.330
<b>We might be able to cross the bridge and get to the exit,
but if they end up following us...</b>

14:53.960 --> 14:54.880
<b>No, not yet...</b>

14:57.380 --> 15:00.000
<b>Not yet... Not yet!</b>

15:17.380 --> 15:18.540
<b>Almost there!</b>

15:23.630 --> 15:25.290
<b>Is that coming from outside the Colosseum?!</b>

15:26.630 --> 15:27.710
<b>You're kidding me...</b>

15:29.380 --> 15:31.710
<b>Mr. Cranel, head for the bridge.</b>

15:32.080 --> 15:32.750
<b>Huh?</b>

15:33.080 --> 15:38.630
<b>Finish off the enemies ahead of us. I'll use my magic
to do something about the enemies behind us.</b>

15:38.790 --> 15:40.210
<b>Then shouldn't I be the one who-</b>

15:40.330 --> 15:42.040
<b>Now in the skies of the distant forest...</b>

15:43.920 --> 15:46.670
<b>...to the infinite stars mounted upon
the eternal firmament of night!</b>

15:49.830 --> 15:50.920
<b>I'll be right back!</b>

16:03.210 --> 16:06.960
<b>This fool doth entreat, just once for
the divine protection of the stars' fire...</b>

16:07.750 --> 16:10.920
<b>Grant thy benevolent light to
the one who abandoned thee!</b>

16:21.880 --> 16:23.290
<b>Miss Ryu is incredible...</b>

16:23.630 --> 16:26.580
<b>So long as I'm with her, I know we can survive anything!</b>

16:39.670 --> 16:40.790
<b>Miss Ryu?</b>

16:44.040 --> 16:45.000
<b>What's she doing?</b>

16:46.210 --> 16:49.670
<b>Let the light of stardust occupy me
and strike my enemy...</b>

16:50.170 --> 16:51.130
<b>Miss Ryu!</b>

16:52.210 --> 16:53.580
<b>Luminous Wind.</b>

17:18.880 --> 17:19.960
<b>Miss Ryu!</b>

17:26.330 --> 17:28.210
<b>But I don't understand...</b>

17:30.540 --> 17:31.460
<b>WHY?!</b>

17:33.000 --> 17:34.080
<b>It's for the best.</b>

17:35.540 --> 17:37.420
<b>She's doing this... to save me?!</b>

17:38.960 --> 17:40.920
<b>No... No!</b>

17:41.210 --> 17:43.250
<b>Miss Ryu! MISS RYU!</b>

17:45.210 --> 17:46.330
<b>Now go on.</b>

17:46.330 --> 17:49.040
<b>MISS RYU?! MISS RYU!</b>

18:01.420 --> 18:06.380
<b>Good. I've armed him with as much
knowledge as I possibly can.</b>

18:08.710 --> 18:12.000
<b>So even without me, he- no...</b>

18:12.460 --> 18:17.630
<b>Once I'm no longer a burden to him,
he should be able to escape the Deep Floors.</b>

18:19.880 --> 18:22.540
<b>You will mourn my decision, no doubt.</b>

18:23.710 --> 18:26.540
<b>Be that as it may... you deserve to live.</b>

18:27.830 --> 18:30.830
<b>Far more than I, after the things I've done...</b>

18:41.540 --> 18:43.710
<b>There's no point in defending myself anymore...</b>

18:49.210 --> 18:51.790
<b>...but I refuse to go down without a fight.</b>

18:52.830 --> 18:59.210
<b>Besides, I'd be too ashamed to face Alise and
the others if I didn't struggle until my very last breath.</b>

19:08.790 --> 19:11.540
<b>So this is to be my grave...</b>

19:21.920 --> 19:28.670
<b>I'm going to die a plaything for monsters, with neither
a corpse nor a shred of my Elven pride to show for it...</b>

19:32.710 --> 19:34.080
<b>But you know what?</b>

19:38.080 --> 19:41.880
<b>That's fine with me. Because I was able to save him.</b>

19:48.580 --> 19:51.750
<b>Forgive me, Syr... Sorry, guys...</b>

19:53.830 --> 19:56.880
<b>I'm squandering the life you gave me.</b>

19:58.500 --> 20:01.210
<b>Alise, please...</b>

20:08.040 --> 20:10.380
<b>Pass judgment on me...</b>

20:19.920 --> 20:20.920
<b>But how?</b>

20:21.540 --> 20:22.830
<b>MISS RYU!</b>

20:30.170 --> 20:32.040
<b>How? How did he...?</b>

20:33.290 --> 20:34.000
<b>He couldn't have...!</b>

20:34.670 --> 20:37.380
<b>And while the right-hand side is connected to the maze...</b>

20:38.420 --> 20:42.170
<b>He went all the way around?! To come and rescue me?!</b>

20:43.210 --> 20:45.290
<b>You idiot! Why would you do that?!</b>

20:45.710 --> 20:47.750
<b>We can't both escape from this place!</b>

20:48.380 --> 20:50.830
<b>There's still time! Turn around and run!</b>

20:53.330 --> 20:54.960
<b>Stop it! Get out of here!</b>

20:55.130 --> 20:57.130
<b>Don't do it! Stay away!</b>

21:04.830 --> 21:08.330
<b>All I wanted was for you to survive...</b>

21:09.210 --> 21:10.290
<b>Why...?</b>

21:15.630 --> 21:16.500
<b>Is that...?</b>

21:28.670 --> 21:29.750
<b>MISS RYU!</b>

21:33.920 --> 21:37.420
<b>What happens if someone manages
to make their ideals a reality?</b>

21:38.540 --> 21:39.670
<b>Isn't it obvious?</b>

21:41.290 --> 21:45.670
<b>Those are the people... we call heroes.</b>

21:52.080 --> 21:53.500
<b>Fire...</b>

21:54.330 --> 21:56.000
<b>BOLT!</b>

23:34.960 --> 23:39.920
<b>Next Time</b>

23:34.960 --> 23:39.920
<b>Astrea Familia</b>

23:34.960 --> 23:39.920
<b>Heroic Death</b>

23:35.830 --> 23:38.830
<b>Next time: "Astrea Familia."</b>
